IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PEN0030.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    COPY PEN0030C REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==IN==.
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    05 ACCT-STATUS        PIC X VALUE 'A'.
    05 PENALTY-AMT        PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM 4000-REPEAT-LATE
    PERFORM COLLECTIONS-CHECK
    DISPLAY "ACCT-STATUS=" ACCT-STATUS
    DISPLAY "PENALTY-AMT=" PENALTY-AMT
    STOP RUN.
4000-REPEAT-LATE.
    IF IN-LATE-CNT-12M >= 3 AND IN-DAYS-LATE > 30
        MOVE 'S' TO ACCT-STATUS
        ADD 100 TO PENALTY-AMT
    END-IF.
COLLECTIONS-CHECK.
    IF IN-DAYS-LATE > 60
        MOVE 'C' TO ACCT-STATUS
    END-IF.
